    "id": "completion:full-d:critter-after-pilot-dig",
    "action": "critter_damage_after_dig",
    "scope": "Shovel critter request, shared damage consumer",
    "roles": [
      {
        "role": "conditional_target",
        "endpointType": "runtime_critter_collider",
        "conditional": true
      }
    ],
    "entry": {
      "input": "ShovelSlot emits CritterDamage for each dug position; flying=false, killEvenIfSquashBugsIsOff=true"
    },
    "conditions": [
      "PlayerAttackSystem clears queued attacks on death. A collider must match the critter property and must not have flying property for this call.",
      "The shared GetDamageInfo path requires its runtime component assumptions and applies immunity, damage calculation and reduction; base 1 is not guaranteed final damage.",
      "PlayerController passes the attacker god-mode lookup as the positional isExplosive argument after showDamageNumber=false; ClientSystem godMode stays its default false. That isExplosive value also reaches the downstream damage/pull-loot parameters.",
      "PlayerGhost target follows RegisterPlayerHit and returns before the non-player EntityUtility.DealDamage path; do not infer component composition from the critter property."
    ],
    "transitions": [
      {
        "from": "request",
        "to": "damage_call",
        "text": "PlayerAttackSystem dispatches to DealCritterDamage, which casts the shovel-size box and calls ClientSystem.DealDamageToEntity with base 1.",
        "refs": [
          "Pug.Other/ShovelSlot.cs:161-175",
          "Pug.Other/PlayerAttackSystem.cs:429-456",
          "Pug.Other/PlayerController.cs:6649-6669"
        ]
      },
      {
        "from": "damage_call",
        "to": "health_buffer",
        "text": "GetDamageInfo calculates damage and immunity, then for a non-PlayerGhost target EntityUtility.DealDamage queues a negative pre-reduction amount when the target has HealthCD. GetDamageInfo indexes target health earlier; do not assume missing HealthCD is safely ignored. A PlayerGhost branches to RegisterPlayerHit and returns.",
        "refs": [
          "Pug.Other/PlayerCommand/ClientSystem.cs:279-287",
          "Pug.Other/PlayerCommand/ClientSystem.cs:292-368",
          "Pug.Other/PlayerCommand/ClientSystem.cs:477-478",
          "Pug.Other/EntityUtility.cs:835-878",
          "Pug.Other/EntityUtility.cs:1491-1567"
        ]
      },
      {
        "from": "health_buffer",
        "to": "health_write",
        "text": "The buffer applies reduction, positive minDamagePerHit even when calculated amount is zero, maxDamagePerHit, and IgnoreDamageFromSelfOrPlayerSource. For applyToNonPredicted=false and disabled Simulate, local processing continues without the final healthLookup write. Otherwise amount is accumulated; wasKilled overrides it to negative current health. ProtectiveArmor can set the accumulated change to zero and skip the health write. Other eligible paths clamp and write HealthCD; the buffer is cleared.",
        "refs": [
          "Pug.Other/UpdateHealthFromBufferSystem.cs:194-302",
          "Pug.Other/UpdateHealthFromBufferSystem.cs:384-435",
          "Pug.Other/UpdateHealthFromBufferSystem.cs:558-560"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "outcomes": [
      {
        "kind": "conditional",
        "text": "Eligible non-player target can receive a calculated health change after all applicable buffer gates; the critter call does not enable the GetDamageInfo godMode argument. No unconditional 1 damage or kill."
      }
    ],
    "negativeCases": [
      {
        "input": "player dead, no eligible collision, or flying critter",
        "expected": "this request does not reach a qualifying target"
      },
      {
        "input": "immune-zone calculation yields zero",
        "expected": "zero calculation alone does not prove unchanged health: a positive minDamagePerHit can make it negative later"
      },
      {
        "input": "non-predicted target with disabled Simulate or qualifying protective armor",
        "expected": "the cited healthLookup write is skipped under the respective code conditions"
      }
    ],
    "boundaries": [
      "Runtime collision, components, faction/status, random state, health and resulting death are unobserved. The PlayerGhost branch is separate and its terminal effects are not investigated here. Corrected C1 is awaiting independent review."
    ]
  },
